WEBVTT

00:01.800 --> 00:05.470
This injustice came to light
because of all of you.

00:05.470 --> 00:07.180
As duke, I thank you.

00:07.630 --> 00:09.150
Especially you, Healran Dewitt.

00:09.880 --> 00:12.610
Your insight and investigative 
abilities are superb.

00:12.870 --> 00:15.190
Won't you help me out at the palace?

00:16.230 --> 00:20.290
No, I have no plans to return
to working at the palace.

00:20.750 --> 00:22.670
I see. That's a shame.

00:22.670 --> 00:24.750
Then come work for me!

00:25.780 --> 00:27.490
You too, Miss Belle!

00:27.830 --> 00:30.200
Of course. That <i>would</i> be an option.

00:30.200 --> 00:31.540
What exactly?

00:31.860 --> 00:34.260
Neema currently has a certain plan.

00:34.750 --> 00:36.660
However, if you get involved,

00:36.660 --> 00:39.090
there's a chance your lives will be at risk.

00:39.090 --> 00:41.950
And for me to explain further,

00:41.950 --> 00:45.560
I'll need you all to swear 
a vow upon your names.

00:47.770 --> 00:51.570
Of course, that includes
 Your Highness as well.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.290
I swear upon my name, Wilhelt Rega 
Gaché, that I will not tell a soul.

01:12.760 --> 01:17.680
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

02:34.380 --> 02:39.880
<b><i>Episode 8   A Lot's Been Decided</i></b>

02:35.580 --> 02:38.970
And that pretty much sums up Neema's plan.

02:41.690 --> 02:42.580
I see.

02:43.060 --> 02:45.610
Gathering the monsters
and making a settlement for them?

02:45.610 --> 02:48.320
That's quite an outlandish idea.

02:48.320 --> 02:51.710
Even the monsters appreciate 
how cute Neema is.

02:51.710 --> 02:52.560
<i>Ralf...</i>

02:52.860 --> 02:56.030
Since he'll be the next duke, 
I'll be putting Ralf in charge.

02:56.950 --> 02:59.770
I'm happy to help if it means
spending time with Neema.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.660
I'll help out, too.

03:01.660 --> 03:02.190
<i>Gah!</i>

03:02.830 --> 03:05.500
Your Highness, you have 
official duties to attend to.

03:06.420 --> 03:09.310
Naturally, I don't plan to ignore them.

03:09.310 --> 03:12.180
I brought my work with me,
so I can assist as I see to it.

03:12.180 --> 03:13.830
<i>Well, then I guess it's okay.</i>

03:14.530 --> 03:16.290
What about you two?

03:16.620 --> 03:17.890
I accept.

03:17.890 --> 03:18.870
Me too!

03:19.170 --> 03:22.330
Then I'd like to go over the terms 
of employment with you two.

03:22.330 --> 03:23.320
Cheep!

03:23.320 --> 03:24.840
<i>That was Nox.</i>

03:25.410 --> 03:26.570
Which means...

03:27.580 --> 03:29.230
Welcome back, Shinki!

03:29.220 --> 03:30.350
SHATTER

03:30.560 --> 03:31.790
How'd it go?

03:31.790 --> 03:34.100
I worked things out with the local goblins.

03:34.100 --> 03:35.790
That's great!

03:37.940 --> 03:41.380
Neema, care to introduce me to this fellow?

03:41.820 --> 03:47.070
Shinki used to be a hobgoblin before he
evolved into this mysterious creature!

03:47.070 --> 03:49.820
A g-goblin?

03:50.500 --> 03:52.400
How could you let this happen, Father?!

03:53.260 --> 03:55.730
Shinki is bound by his true name.

03:55.730 --> 03:57.990
Just think of him as Neema's bodyguard.

03:59.660 --> 04:03.320
<i>Ralf can't object as long as Papa approves.</i>

04:03.320 --> 04:06.210
So, Shinki, can you fill me in on the details?

04:06.480 --> 04:09.610
Sure. The goblins that 
were appearing around here

04:09.610 --> 04:12.340
are a horde of sixteen led by a hobgoblin.

04:12.340 --> 04:15.240
I tried to explain the plan, 
but they didn't understand.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.430
So I fought them and now they serve me.

04:17.950 --> 04:20.110
The bugs are showing them the way,

04:20.110 --> 04:21.960
so I'm sure they'll find the cave.

04:21.960 --> 04:24.780
<i>Er, those "bugs" are spirits.</i>

04:25.120 --> 04:28.480
I suppose we can say
 the goblins are handled, then.

04:28.900 --> 04:33.590
Father, do you have any information 
about the kobolds in Lenice?

04:33.590 --> 04:38.770
There are reports of a large horde
and an attack on a caravan.

04:39.410 --> 04:40.710
Mr. Squad Leader!

04:41.760 --> 04:44.170
The reality is probably worse, right?

04:44.170 --> 04:44.910
Yes.

04:45.290 --> 04:47.420
There are around a hundred kobolds,

04:47.420 --> 04:50.190
and apart from their main force, 
they split into five groups.

04:50.190 --> 04:54.120
Each one seems to have a specific duty,
such as guarding or scouting.

04:54.120 --> 04:56.280
The groups are commanded by high kobolds,

04:56.280 --> 04:59.640
and leading the main force is said 
to be a werewolf of even higher rank.

05:00.060 --> 05:02.820
A werewolf?! Where did you learn that?

05:03.070 --> 05:05.750
We asked the adventurers'
guild for assistance.

05:05.750 --> 05:07.210
Next, we'll be moving out

05:07.210 --> 05:09.850
to Lenice next to take
corrective action on the matter.

05:09.850 --> 05:13.360
I beg your pardon,
but what is the person in charge like?

05:13.740 --> 05:15.340
The person in charge?

05:16.430 --> 05:17.660
Of course.

05:17.660 --> 05:19.830
Someone may be stopping information

05:19.830 --> 05:21.290
from reaching the royal capital.

05:21.520 --> 05:24.400
I've heard that the regional commander

05:24.400 --> 05:27.180
used to work at central headquarters

05:27.180 --> 05:29.880
before being stationed here on reassignment.

05:31.230 --> 05:32.930
<i>In other words, he got demoted.</i>

05:32.930 --> 05:35.360
<i>Though I guess that's not enough evidence...</i>

05:35.360 --> 05:38.640
The folks who attacked Shinki 
were supposedly adventurers.

05:38.640 --> 05:41.380
So they were either people posing as such,

05:41.380 --> 05:43.320
or someone made a request of the guild.

05:43.720 --> 05:46.230
Either way, the odds are increasingly likely

05:46.230 --> 05:48.250
that our enemies are many and organized.

05:48.250 --> 05:48.950
Excuse me...

05:49.290 --> 05:52.090
Shall I check with the adventurers' guild?

05:52.090 --> 05:54.620
I can find which office put out the request.

05:54.860 --> 05:56.600
We'd be grateful,

05:56.600 --> 06:00.380
but as long as we don't know where 
the enemy may be hiding, it's dangerous.

06:01.340 --> 06:05.550
You think there might be spies 
in other provinces and the knighthood?

06:06.990 --> 06:09.770
Yes. I believe that to be a probability.

06:09.770 --> 06:13.660
<i>That means there are spies
 everywhere, doesn't it?</i>

06:13.660 --> 06:16.470
<i>This whole situation might 
be way worse than I thought.</i>

06:17.990 --> 06:20.270
Don't worry, Neema.

06:20.270 --> 06:22.860
His Highness is always one step ahead.

06:24.670 --> 06:29.490
<i>That's right. As a noblewoman, 
I always need to be smiling.</i>

06:29.920 --> 06:30.820
Of course!

06:35.730 --> 06:38.090
Since we don't know where the enemy may be,

06:38.090 --> 06:42.160
we'll need to refer to them by a name 
that only we understand.

06:42.160 --> 06:45.400
So henceforth, our enemy shall 
be known as Runohark.

06:45.400 --> 06:47.860
And we shall call the attack on the monsters

06:47.860 --> 06:49.600
the Southern Province Incident.

06:51.600 --> 06:56.210
<i>Um, runoharks are like...
that one insect from my past life, right?</i>

06:56.210 --> 06:58.660
<i>I see. This way, no one will bat an eye</i>

06:58.660 --> 07:01.680
<i>if we talk about eliminating
or being attacked by them.</i>

07:01.950 --> 07:03.900
I return to the capital tomorrow,

07:03.900 --> 07:05.780
but Ralf will continue my inspection.

07:06.040 --> 07:08.990
Can I ask that you continue
to protect him and company?

07:08.990 --> 07:11.570
I know the knighthood serves the citizenry,

07:11.570 --> 07:13.960
so I realize what I'm asking of you.

07:17.700 --> 07:20.950
We believe that protecting 
the Osphe family is the best thing

07:20.950 --> 07:22.870
we can do for the people right now.

07:24.730 --> 07:25.830
Everyone...

07:26.430 --> 07:30.420
Thank you very much! I look 
forward to working with all of you!

07:30.710 --> 07:34.140
Father, about us going to Lenice...

07:35.940 --> 07:37.980
You won't listen even if I say no.

07:39.700 --> 07:43.180
Right! I want to include the 
kobolds in my plan, too!

07:43.510 --> 07:48.010
All right. The adults have some 
things to discuss now. You go rest.

07:48.010 --> 07:49.960
Right! Lars!

07:49.960 --> 07:51.810
Let's nap together!

07:51.810 --> 07:53.030
Not so fast, Neema.

07:53.560 --> 07:56.950
Lars is Will's holy beast, 
so you should nap with me instead.

07:57.270 --> 07:59.110
I'm going to nap with Lars!

07:59.110 --> 08:01.650
Now, don't be difficult.

08:01.650 --> 08:02.790
Then...

08:03.230 --> 08:05.250
I'm gonna nap with Shinki!

08:05.250 --> 08:06.460
Irk

08:06.800 --> 08:09.170
We'll just be borrowing Shinki for a bit.

08:09.170 --> 08:11.800
There's lots I'd like to ask him.

08:11.800 --> 08:13.030
Yay!

08:13.300 --> 08:15.510
Okay, Lars. You sit here.

08:19.830 --> 08:22.270
Come on out, Gratia.

08:23.940 --> 08:27.970
Don't worry. He's not scary. 
He's a premium floof!

08:31.400 --> 08:32.700
See?

08:32.700 --> 08:34.610
Okay, now it's my turn!

08:35.070 --> 08:36.970
Floof!

08:38.090 --> 08:42.180
<i>Ah, that premium fluff... I'm so happy.</i>

08:42.880 --> 08:48.420
<i>Okay, tomorrow we set out 
for Lenice to meet some kobolds!</i>

08:51.600 --> 08:54.420
Let's go over things once more
before we reach Lenice.

08:54.950 --> 08:57.530
About Neema's plan...

08:59.180 --> 09:01.470
Calling it that over and over is inconvenient.

09:01.470 --> 09:03.590
Maybe we should give it a proper name.

09:04.080 --> 09:06.310
Hmm, yes.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.400
How about "Operation: Get Along with Monsters"?

09:09.950 --> 09:13.000
<i>Ralf, that's unbearably lame!</i>

09:13.000 --> 09:16.120
<i>And don't forget the adventurers
will be a huge part of this!</i>

09:16.120 --> 09:20.100
Come on, now. Don't give 
it such a stupid name, Ralf.

09:21.900 --> 09:24.400
Then what's <i>your</i> brilliant idea?

09:24.400 --> 09:25.210
Me?

09:25.620 --> 09:26.780
Well...

09:28.240 --> 09:30.500
How about the Shiana Project?

09:30.850 --> 09:32.280
"Shiana"?

09:32.280 --> 09:34.220
<i>That's not Larshian, is it?</i>

09:34.220 --> 09:37.700
In Celestian, it means strength and courage.

09:38.270 --> 09:41.170
It seems the God of Divine Creation
 has taken a liking to you.

09:41.310 --> 09:42.260
<b>Badump</b>

09:42.260 --> 09:44.140
Th-That's not true...

09:44.670 --> 09:50.200
Lars, the great Sol, Shinki, 
and that spider... Gratia, was it?

09:50.200 --> 09:53.860
You have rather extraordinary 
powers gathering around you.

09:54.280 --> 09:57.280
Of course we're going to think
 God brought them to you.

09:59.730 --> 10:03.950
It's not just me! God loves us all!

10:03.950 --> 10:06.490
That includes both you and Ralf!

10:07.210 --> 10:07.990
I suppose.

10:08.640 --> 10:12.210
Being of royal blood
makes us somewhat special.

10:12.210 --> 10:14.960
I'm sure he cares 
for us at least a little bit.

10:15.300 --> 10:19.220
<i>Uh... Considering you have
Lars the ultimate floof,</i>

10:19.220 --> 10:22.240
<i>I'd bet he likes you a </i>lot<i>.</i>

10:27.230 --> 10:30.230
What?! You came home and left Neema?!

10:30.490 --> 10:33.570
Yes, but Ralf is with her, so she's fine.

10:33.900 --> 10:35.770
Unbelievable.

10:36.280 --> 10:38.780
Neema is still only five years old!

10:36.320 --> 10:42.490
<i><b>HISS!</b></i>

10:38.780 --> 10:42.490
Do you understand how dangerous it is 
for her outside of the royal capital?!

10:42.490 --> 10:43.780
It's fine.

10:43.780 --> 10:46.480
Both the fire dragon and Lars are with her.

10:46.480 --> 10:48.460
She has other attendants now, too.

10:48.460 --> 10:51.660
So what's Neema plotting this time?

10:52.880 --> 10:55.630
You really see through everything.
Truth is...

10:56.000 --> 11:00.830
<i>That's when Mother and I learned
 about the countless monsters</i>

11:00.830 --> 11:04.090
<i>appearing in our domain
and that someone was behind it all.</i>

11:04.610 --> 11:09.150
<i>I don't believe this...
Monsters are also God's creations.</i>

11:09.140 --> 11:14.650
MENACING

11:09.730 --> 11:12.870
<i>And yet someone's using them
for their own benefit.</i>

11:12.870 --> 11:14.740
<i>What punishment will befall them?</i>

11:14.740 --> 11:17.350
<i>Just the thought makes me hope
they'll get their just deserts!</i>

11:17.790 --> 11:18.570
Karna.

11:18.900 --> 11:23.200
You look just like Dayle when 
he's thinking of something evil.

11:23.700 --> 11:25.530
That's what I look like...?

11:25.920 --> 11:30.010
So, our daughter wants to create 
a ranch for all of the monsters.

11:30.360 --> 11:33.970
A ranch? Well, I guess 
that's one way to put it.

11:33.970 --> 11:38.250
Then I'll start gathering staff for the ranch.

11:38.250 --> 11:41.030
I'll approach various guilds with the idea

11:41.030 --> 11:43.650
and select any promising individuals I find.

11:44.490 --> 11:46.900
<i>I wonder what I should do...</i>

11:46.900 --> 11:50.140
<i>If I had an idea of how 
Neema wanted to build this,</i>

11:48.160 --> 11:50.330
I love you, Karna!

11:50.140 --> 11:53.100
<i>I could begin collecting
 materials and preparing.</i>

11:54.340 --> 11:55.430
Father!

11:55.430 --> 11:57.830
I'd like to go see Neema.

11:57.830 --> 12:00.570
I'd love to indulge you,
but the prince is with her.

12:00.570 --> 12:02.590
The bodyguards are already maxed out.

12:02.590 --> 12:03.020
But—

12:03.300 --> 12:07.710
In that case, why don't we hire
bodyguards from the adventurers' guild?

12:08.070 --> 12:09.770
The adventurers' guild?

12:09.770 --> 12:14.340
Yes. Coincidentally, we just 
received a letter from Phillip.

12:14.630 --> 12:16.370
Oh, Uncle Phillip!

12:16.740 --> 12:20.310
I think the last time I saw him
 was when Neema was born.

12:21.200 --> 12:25.090
He says he'll be arriving in the capital
 tomorrow, so he'd love to see us all.

12:25.090 --> 12:26.580
I see.

12:26.580 --> 12:29.100
He was a close associate of mine

12:29.100 --> 12:31.820
when I was an adventurer
to gain combat experience.

12:31.820 --> 12:35.570
He's also one of the few
 purple-ranked adventurers,

12:35.570 --> 12:37.910
so he'd be a perfect instructor for Karna.

12:38.180 --> 12:40.360
Huh? An instructor?

12:40.760 --> 12:45.070
Thinking of your future, you should at 
least experience subjugating monsters.

12:46.460 --> 12:52.940
<i>But... depending on what Father does, 
we may also end up targets of this enemy.</i>

12:53.970 --> 12:56.010
Sounds like fun!

12:57.750 --> 13:00.700
There are many dangers 
outside the royal capital.

13:00.700 --> 13:02.100
Are you prepared for that?

13:02.430 --> 13:04.830
Yes! I'll take on anything!

13:04.830 --> 13:09.020
I must become stronger 
so that I can stay by Neema's side.

13:09.020 --> 13:12.890
In that case, Karna, 
prepare everything you'll need.

13:12.890 --> 13:16.990
There's no point if you don't do it for 
yourself. Especially with your weapon.

13:16.990 --> 13:17.590
Right!

13:18.570 --> 13:20.440
<i>Wait for me, Neema!</i>

13:20.440 --> 13:22.820
<i>I'm going to do my absolute best!</i>

13:29.410 --> 13:32.190
This is Lenice?

13:33.860 --> 13:36.400
<i>I wonder where the kobolds are.</i>

13:36.910 --> 13:39.460
<i>I want to see them already.</i>

13:39.460 --> 13:40.320
Neema.

13:41.360 --> 13:43.220
Make sure you behave.

13:43.220 --> 13:45.410
We don't know what may happen from here.

13:45.410 --> 13:47.360
R-Right...

13:48.430 --> 13:53.130
<i>That's right. This is the front line 
of the battle with the kobolds.</i>

13:56.070 --> 14:02.060
Prince Wilhelt and Duke Osphe's
 children have arrived.

14:02.060 --> 14:03.190
We request entry.

14:05.930 --> 14:07.320
One moment.

14:17.770 --> 14:22.370
I beg your pardon. Your Highness, 
the captain would like to greet you.

14:22.370 --> 14:23.280
All right.

14:24.110 --> 14:26.890
They probably want to confirm it's really you.

14:26.890 --> 14:30.950
That's fine. I'm sure they're 
desperate to protect their city.

14:31.680 --> 14:33.420
You wait here, Neema.

14:33.420 --> 14:34.560
What?!

14:41.470 --> 14:42.690
<i>Fine then!</i>

14:43.120 --> 14:46.490
Wind spirits, fill me in 
on what's going on outside.

14:49.420 --> 14:51.690
Good work, men. At ease.

14:51.690 --> 14:54.100
<i>I can hear Will's voice.</i>

14:54.100 --> 14:55.080
Sir!

14:56.500 --> 15:01.500
I am traveling unannounced as a companion
of this gentleman, Ralfreed Osphe.

15:01.800 --> 15:03.880
Greetings. I am Dylan Noctis,

15:03.880 --> 15:06.960
commander of the Parzeth District Office
 and member of the First Legion.

15:07.210 --> 15:11.930
I do beg your pardon, but this area
is dangerous due to rogue kobolds.

15:11.930 --> 15:14.500
You should probably leave 
as soon as possible.

15:15.880 --> 15:18.480
We are here on my father's orders.

15:18.480 --> 15:22.260
I am monitoring the monster sightings
 on behalf of the duke.

15:22.260 --> 15:24.580
I-I see...

15:26.740 --> 15:31.210
Very well. Then I shall show you
 to the proxy lord.

15:31.950 --> 15:33.650
<i>Sounds like things worked out!</i>

15:35.620 --> 15:38.270
I'm glad they believed us so quickly.

15:38.270 --> 15:39.460
Of course they did.

15:40.750 --> 15:45.120
<i>Those two are so in synch! 
They'll be a lot of help.</i>

15:49.610 --> 15:51.610
<b>Run down...</b>

15:49.990 --> 15:53.050
Thank you for coming all this way.

15:53.290 --> 15:56.130
Marquis Parzeth, have you 
been getting enough sleep?

15:56.390 --> 16:01.460
Well... We've had so many kobolds 
appearing lately, so not really.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.810
<i>Who's that other old guy?</i>

16:04.250 --> 16:08.280
<i>Is he the one who got demoted? 
I guess he </i>is<i> wearing armor.</i>

16:10.080 --> 16:11.240
<i>More importantly...</i>

16:11.580 --> 16:14.560
<i>Whoever decorated this 
room has </i>terrible<i> taste!</i>

16:15.340 --> 16:18.420
Now, about dealing with these kobolds...

16:18.720 --> 16:21.460
The knights cannot keep up with them,

16:21.460 --> 16:23.550
so we've contacted the adventurers' guild.

16:23.550 --> 16:26.190
They're apparently putting together
an extermination squad.

16:26.190 --> 16:28.410
When will they make their move?

16:28.410 --> 16:32.010
Once Red Hlaada arrives.

16:32.010 --> 16:33.350
Hlaada?

16:33.760 --> 16:35.460
I've heard of them before.

16:35.460 --> 16:39.340
Though I think they were still
Blue Hlaada back then.

16:39.590 --> 16:42.440
<i>Even the prince knows about this party?</i>

16:42.440 --> 16:45.060
<i>They must be really strong...</i>

16:45.060 --> 16:47.680
<i>Wait! That means they'll 
wipe out all the kobolds!</i>

16:47.680 --> 16:48.750
<i>That can't happen!</i>

16:48.750 --> 16:53.490
<i>I need to make contact with the 
kobolds before these people show up!</i>

16:53.490 --> 16:54.140
Neema?

16:54.450 --> 16:58.450
I-If there's time, it's okay 
to look around the city, right?

16:58.450 --> 16:58.990
What?

17:00.210 --> 17:05.010
If we can see the city inside and out,
we can better report to our father.

17:05.010 --> 17:06.450
<i>Nice one, Ralf!</i>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.680
We have members of the royal knights with us.

17:10.680 --> 17:12.700
We'll be fine to take a quick look.

17:12.700 --> 17:15.070
I-I see.

17:15.070 --> 17:17.250
Well, if it's just for a bit...

17:23.310 --> 17:24.370
This is...

17:25.570 --> 17:29.410
This place isn't too bad since the 
knights still patrol through here.

17:30.150 --> 17:31.550
Let's head to the slums.

17:38.780 --> 17:41.530
These children are definitely malnourished.

17:41.530 --> 17:44.580
Marquis Parzeth should be
supplying them with aid.

17:44.890 --> 17:48.020
Perhaps someone's intercepting it.

17:48.570 --> 17:51.050
I guess we'll just have to look into this.

17:51.440 --> 17:55.130
<i>I can't believe this is still Gaché...</i>

17:56.580 --> 17:57.570
What was that?!

17:57.570 --> 17:58.190
Neema?

18:02.380 --> 18:03.060
Shinki!

18:07.610 --> 18:08.510
Take that!

18:08.510 --> 18:09.620
And that!

18:10.060 --> 18:11.050
What are you doing?

18:12.530 --> 18:15.290
Th-This doesn't concern you,
stupid outsiders!

18:18.140 --> 18:19.570
<i>There's something there...</i>

18:20.750 --> 18:22.040
A puppy?!

18:25.650 --> 18:27.450
What have you done?!

18:28.880 --> 18:31.910
M-My dad said all dogs are enemies!

18:32.180 --> 18:34.360
What's wrong with beating up an enemy?

18:35.540 --> 18:39.370
<i>Uh, I'm pretty sure the dogs your dad
is talking about are kobolds.</i>

18:39.710 --> 18:42.290
Is that poor thing really your enemy?

18:43.330 --> 18:45.210
Even if it was,

18:45.210 --> 18:49.550
it's shameful to attack someone 
so completely defenseless!

18:51.750 --> 18:53.220
Shut up, shrimp!

18:55.710 --> 18:58.270
L-Let go of me!

18:56.190 --> 18:58.270
Hey, quit struggling.

18:59.220 --> 19:01.750
You mustn't immediately
resort to brute force.

19:02.740 --> 19:07.130
Because true strength should 
be used to protect the weak.

19:07.950 --> 19:13.170
We will do you no harm, 
so please, hand over the poor thing.

19:23.700 --> 19:25.400
He's badly hurt...

19:25.400 --> 19:29.170
<i>I'll need Ralf to use a healing 
spell on him immediately.</i>

19:30.870 --> 19:33.450
What is it that you want to protect?

19:33.730 --> 19:36.390
Is it not them?

19:37.520 --> 19:40.240
What do you know, you dumb noble?

19:40.810 --> 19:43.640
True power is not just physical strength.

19:44.630 --> 19:46.780
If you can stay on the right path,

19:46.780 --> 19:48.830
without becoming underhanded or a coward,

19:49.190 --> 19:54.050
and gain honorable strength 
like these knights here...

19:55.010 --> 19:59.240
You'll become a wonderful man
who can protect what's important to you.

20:02.490 --> 20:06.630
I'm Belgar, son of the 
adventurer Guy Crius the Red!

20:06.930 --> 20:11.140
I'm gonna be as strong as my dad 
so that I can protect everyone!

20:11.390 --> 20:15.260
My name is Nefertima Osphe. 
I will remember you.

20:22.510 --> 20:24.710
Recul Cresiolle.

20:33.840 --> 20:35.590
He'll be all right now.

20:36.230 --> 20:38.060
Thank goodness!

20:38.890 --> 20:40.590
That tickles!

20:41.580 --> 20:44.080
Where's your mommy?

20:47.510 --> 20:48.690
The forest?

20:49.520 --> 20:54.940
What does that mean?
So you're not someone's pet?

20:54.940 --> 20:57.230
My lady, you apparently haven't noticed,

20:57.230 --> 20:59.320
but that's a kobold pup.

21:00.540 --> 21:01.660
Huh?

21:02.630 --> 21:06.860
<i>A kobold?! This is clearly a Shiba Inu!</i>

21:07.240 --> 21:10.510
Neema sure has some luck...

21:10.490 --> 21:12.830
God really does favor her.

21:13.620 --> 21:18.800
But returning him to his mother would
surely be asking to get attacked by kobolds.

21:18.800 --> 21:20.960
Even if we have him in tow?

21:20.960 --> 21:23.750
They'll probably think you kidnapped him.

21:33.560 --> 21:37.390
I'm sorry I made you worry. It'll be okay.

21:39.240 --> 21:42.300
Let's go! Since Lars,
a holy beast, is with us,

21:42.300 --> 21:45.070
the kobolds won't attack immediately!

21:50.280 --> 21:53.400
You're <i>such</i> a pushover
when it comes to Neema.

21:55.420 --> 21:59.560
<i>I'll make sure you get back to your mommy!</i>

23:35.100 --> 23:39.930
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.100 --> 23:39.930
<b>Master of the Forest, Please...!</b>
